        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "cb8b1049-be71-53ac-900d-e9750331528b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Aadesh Shrivastava, Shankar Mahadevan, Pritam, Himesh Reshammiya, Abhijeet Bhattacharya, Alka Yagnik, Lalit Pandit, Jatin Pandit\n- Products: Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, STAR Voice of India\n- Roles: mentors, judges\n\nFacts:\n- In Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, Aadesh Shrivastava, Shankar Mahadevan, and Pritam were introduced as new mentors.\n- In Sa Re Ga Ma Pa Challenge 2009, Himesh Reshammiya joined them after serving as a judge in the previous edition.\n- Aadesh Shrivastava died of cancer in Kokilaben Hospital one day after turning 51.\n- STAR Voice of India featured judges from the Sa Re Ga Ma Pa series, including Aadesh Shrivastava, Abhijeet Bhattacharya, Alka Yagnik, Lalit Pandit, and Jatin Pandit.",
